{"id":1728,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为深入树立和践行正确政绩观，传承红色革命精神，筑牢党员教师初心使命，2026年7月12日，航空宇航学院党委组织部分教师党员赴吕梁市兴县蔡家崖革命根据地，开展“追寻红色足迹，赓续红色血脉；深学细悟政绩观，实干担当践初心”主题党日活动。活动途中，我院教师党员与仪器与电子学院“军工红心”暑期社会实践团在晋绥边区革命纪念馆偶遇，师生共同进行参观和学习。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lUN-riozvPolCYnIz9YnNVVMzNsLz657oRvZn7MVo7UsnRU0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yYn1ybL1yanz-ao7VfnzLsM4G8MRNYM4rVnRlsozGZnRrFMl7aoR74Um6FL49YU4-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzUsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11547&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F2F920E208AAE3770449275ED57908D5/5A0813B7/382C2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 700px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lUN-riozvPolCYnIz9YnNVVMzNsLz657oRvZn7MVo7UsnRU0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yYn1ybL1yanz-ao7VfnzLsM4G8MRNYM4rVnRlsozGZnRrFMl7aoR74Um6FL49YU4-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzUsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11547&e=.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lM8CrbMmVkMm6VLIzWVMmnkLlV7MRG5DUNW7MNnRU8CbMRL0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyaM1yYnkysoz6fnzMVoznkLl7aUN7DozlPMmAVM4-PL8MFUmvaL8UinzfFL4NDLNCJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzUsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11547&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7062D797AE3E94B1A0BA695168E7213C/B703D5E0/3962F\" vheight=\" 394px\" vwidth=\" 699px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lM4LrDnRnfUN7iUI8lYMRA2LmWVUzM5VMRCanlMVL87bMz-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yiLSh7UYhRLzCsLRr2UNlaLmvYnzl8LRNZM8rfnmWRMNWFLmV2nlCbU8QFnmV7MRGJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzUsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11547&e=.png\"></p><p>活动中，全体党员先后参观了晋绥边区革命纪念馆、中共中央晋绥分局窑洞旧址群。通过聆听现场讲解，学习到了革命烈士李林浴血报国的悲壮故事、六柳亭背后贺龙元帅与边区军民同心奋斗红色故事、开明绅士牛友兰倾家支援革命的奉献事迹；通过参观馆内珍贵的史料文物，党员同志们深刻体会到晋绥边区艰苦卓绝的革命斗争历程，感悟到革命先辈与爱国人士扎根人民、务实担当、无私奉献的崇高精神，进一步夯实了“立党为公、执政为民”的初心本色。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lLmLrZL4G4Lm-YUI4ffoR7DL7LiUz-5sMmW7nR9iL8LDLzl0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPoSyZLYhVnN7DLmU8Um7DMz6fM4UYozr7Uz7sUmGZLzTFMmGbMz6VoRrFMzlDLRvJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzUsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11547&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B1983EFA6244B1657A74295DA17B0819/60957E85/55607\" vheight=\" 493px\" vwidth=\" 700px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lUlCranNM7Ul-aLIzCsMz9YM8Q2U4f57UzUiU4NbUmL8oRU0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyDnkyZMSh2Ml-PnR7bU8-4nRN8o7rRMRVRLlUanmvPnNMFMlnfU4A2MmQFnl-Zoz-Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzUsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11547&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lMRCrPLm-sUNlbLIzlbLz-YoRvPoz75bM4C4UzvsLm-aLz90gihFp2hmCIa0U1yaU1hkL1h7M8nRMzMRolrkoRl8UlnfnlWkn7rkoRUDolVFLzNaM4l8nRVFM4NPLzUJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzUsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11547&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B0BB2D7DC53C9EB854ADAEBBDEB8469A/190754D1/79114\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 700px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lLRLrio7Ciol-bLI7Q2nzCZUllso7C5iUzNaUl-PUNCYnl70gihFp2hmCIa0LkyaokyiU1yPM8UPLRNDnzUiL49PLzr7UmQVMlW2L8MRUmMFMz62MzQVolMFLzAVL8VfgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLzl8MYbw62C8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11547&e=.png\"></p><p>参观晋绥军区司令部旧址后，全体党员站在丁香树下，面向党旗，重温了入党誓词，进一步强化了党员身份意识与使命担当。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lolVrRMmTfMNr2oIlCZnRUYMmnVL8C5YnR98nmG4oR7aLRv0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4oky4MkhkLzlYUN7ZnmffolLYLz6kLNV2MmTfolnRLlMFUmL8Uz-aL7VFMlUsMzvJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzUsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11547&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/43834B152BA8F0A9C217B2AF69A9DC1C/B34A200A/5D757\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 700px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ln7UrPU8LaLNUioIz9snNW7nzTfLz65fLN-8L8MkMRNYM4U0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yiLShRUYh2U4UPnRQVLzlPnNWRU8LiMNL4MNCZozGsMmrFM4rRU4WRnmTFLzUbL478gjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLzl8MYbw62C8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11547&e=.png\"></p><p>本次沉浸式主题党日活动，是全体党员一次深刻的党性淬炼。通过参观学习，党员们纷纷表示，在以后的教学和工作中，发扬“艰苦奋斗、顾全大局、自强不息、勇于创新”的吕梁精神，把红色感悟转化为育人实干动力，立足教学科研管理岗位，践行立德树人根本任务，务实服务师生、深耕学科建设，以过硬作风推动学院各项事业高质量发展！</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lUN-riozvPolCYnIz9YnNVVMzNsLz657oRvZn7MVo7UsnRU0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yYn1ybL1yanz-ao7VfnzLsM4G8MRNYM4rVnRlsozGZnRrFMl7aoR74Um6FL49YU4-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzUsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11547&e=.jpg"}